# Coordinate in docs

All communication between agents working on this project happens in Markdown files in
`specs/coordination/`, never agent to agent. Follow `specs/coordination/README.md`:

- Write only your own `specs/coordination/<component>.md`; read the others' before starting and
  before finishing a task.
- Status, questions, requests, decisions and final reports go in that file as dated entries.
- A chat message to or from another agent only names the file to read; it carries no content.
- Contract changes (`specs/contracts/`, `src/copilot_contracts/`) only after a REQUEST and a
  DECISION recorded in `specs/coordination/orchestrator.md`.
